(4160, 4, '2021-10-07 16:50:25', '2021-10-07 08:50:25', '<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本總會於 7/19線上舉辦第28屆第三次理監事會議，共約500多位理監事參與。隨後舉行第28、29屆總會長和監事長交接典禮，由選委主委 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl q66pz984 gpro0wi8 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E5%8A%89%E7%BE%8E%E5%BE%B7?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVaauf7-BoTlHap5e92pSfDO4BtqiBV7RO9aOAOzRd17SARMdnbOuM9Z6U3eHFqjwnj_1z7mQDwqgNzaOd1JNyKx-_BFAwr2KjCDWvv3Iaw_R2MQxnfpY_wBsauB99g9Kx9ZacgOQ--vX7qH3a1ZXiFO4jbo2J5Rkej2sxbkNVhiEPC_OJYEG-jDywZy8N6ris&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">劉美德</a> 頒發當選證書，並在僑委會委員長 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl q66pz984 gpro0wi8 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E7%AB%A5%E6%8C%AF%E6%BA%90?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVaauf7-BoTlHap5e92pSfDO4BtqiBV7RO9aOAOzRd17SARMdnbOuM9Z6U3eHFqjwnj_1z7mQDwqgNzaOd1JNyKx-_BFAwr2KjCDWvv3Iaw_R2MQxnfpY_wBsauB99g9Kx9ZacgOQ--vX7qH3a1ZXiFO4jbo2J5Rkej2sxbkNVhiEPC_OJYEG-jDywZy8N6ris&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">童振源</a> 的見證下，第29屆總會長江福龍，以及監事長洪勝統正式交接，肩負起服務亞洲僑臺商的重責。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"pq6dq46d tbxw36s4 knj5qynh kvgmc6g5 ditlmg2l oygrvhab nvdbi5me sf5mxxl7 gl3lb2sf hhz5lgdu\"><img src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td9/1.5/16/1f64f.png\" alt=\"🙏\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>感謝第28屆總會長 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzci