(4304, 4, '2022-03-09 10:38:43', '2022-03-09 02:38:43', '本總會於11月10日與資策會舉辦智慧農漁業數位分身座談會，由總會長江福龍率團，共30位理監事參加，當日參訪蕈優生物科技有限公司(蘑菇部落)、玉美生技。\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/attachment/1110/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4259\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4259 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/1110-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4260\"><img class=\"wp-image-4260 alignleft\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110-2-700x525.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"341\" height=\"256\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/1110-3/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4261\"><img class=\"wp-image-4261 alignright\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110-3-700x525.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"335\" height=\"251\" /></a>', '智慧農漁業數位分身座談會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4258-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-03-09 10:38:43', '2022-03-09 02:38:43', '', 4258, 'https://astcc.asia/4258-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
