(4544, 1, '2022-08-19 10:47:40', '2022-08-19 02:47:40', '本總會於11月10日與資策會舉辦智慧農漁業數位分身座談會，由總會長江福龍率團，共30位理監事參加，當日參訪蕈優生物科技有限公司(蘑菇部落)、玉美生技。\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/attachment/1110/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4259\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4259 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/1110-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4260\"><img class=\"wp-image-4260 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110-2-700x525.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"535\" height=\"401\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%99%ba%e6%85%a7%e8%be%b2%e6%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e6%95%b8%e4%bd%8d%e5%88%86%e8%ba%ab%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83/1110-3/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4261\"><img class=\"wp-image-4261 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/1110-3-700x525.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"599\" height=\"449\" /></a>', '智慧農漁業數位分身座談會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4258-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:47:40', '2022-08-19 02:47:40', '', 4258, 'https://astcc.asia/4258-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4546, 1, '2022-08-19 10:48:26', '2022-08-19 02:48:26', '<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本總會 <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 q66pz984 b1v8xokw\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E6%B1%9F%E7%A6%8F%E9%BE%8D?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZWp6LGflcfGXjE4uAOtwqPSHgXygv8D8MflR6xD2AGOz_ArdQUV9CmHvx_6Q1gBtTf9Z5sNftVnaoQnXF9pz6F5KyPd2NEfKnSZXO6De8mVhNxZ3Yplzth5MA4adoErpSmKaa2jlKKfCL6QTeI5ElWeoBYjtNXJ02NA9gF8gAPaIG9G59a917zKa-WM1qbgf0k&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#江福龍</a> 總會長於（16）日應邀出席至內政部消防署訓練中心，參加「台灣消防發展與交流協會」成立大會。</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">交通部前部長、無任所大使林佳龍代表台灣消防發展與交流協會，與台灣亞洲交流基金會、台灣東南亞與南亞協會、三棲救難協會、世界台商總會、亞洲台商總會，共同簽署「印太城市與地方韌性合作聯盟」宣言，將共同升民間合作及國際能見度。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql o9v6fnle ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新聞來源: <a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl gpro0wi8 py34i1dx\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.nownews.com%2Fnews%2F5688783%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR3OEn6s20VbrvpsyVGU3v7nt7Q9X40snXPlK_OtU_Q6Gujy5bUgsJlli_I&amp;h=AT3Lbd0a0FA9K9TkLZ9QRF54esttvQG6AmWAjespq1hPb3OOUv6kN5lrCFINxVgw82u94IWsUvkpKkNgekbpnekN9q0laYEJ1BsMB1fHD54aSd848K163tbQiMRx_CqZ0hbi&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT0QyjWpT43GJ-cQis6o3foGVOiyxOsEY5ub6xALDDual_f-qNDY1DZB_-0ogIdeVcEKWk8ppyfIg4G-ziSwZ0jyZtyxowh2aLgUdkIb_Qqs8IIUx2e78Zp3oLvRlNq9GszxLlIBjJS8bSzzcg76X33bWJ7yL3S72m2oXPB2mp0a-g6MgF9sE3sSnywM06GtxrOuC9Se\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://www.nownews.com/news/5688783</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e6%b6%88%e9%98%b2%e7%99%bc%e5%b1%95%e8%88%87%e4%ba%a4%e6%b5%81%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83%e6%88%90%e7%ab%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%9c%83/%e6%b6%88%e9%98%b2%e6%88%90%e7%ab%8b%e5%a4%a7%e6%9c%83/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4394\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4394 size-large\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/消防成立大會-700x466.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"466\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '台灣消防發展與交流協會成立大會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4393-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:48:26', '2022-08-19 02:48:26', '', 4393, 'https://astcc.asia/4393-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
