(4562, 1, '2022-08-19 10:56:01', '2022-08-19 02:56:01', '本會總會長江福龍、財務長莊炳陽、名譽監事長張南蘋及台北辦公室王祈函主任於10月14日一同前往台中市政府，由台中市政府副市長狐榮達接見，商談亞總第二十九屆第二次理監事會議在台中林酒店舉辦事宜。<!--more--><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e5%b8%82%e6%94%bf%e5%ba%9c/%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e5%b8%82%e6%94%bf%e5%ba%9c/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4241\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4241 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/台中市政府.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e5%b8%82%e6%94%bf%e5%ba%9c/%e5%8f%b0%e4%b8%ad%e5%b8%82%e6%94%bf%e5%ba%9c2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4242\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4242 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/台中市政府2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a>', '拜會台中市政府', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4240-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:56:01', '2022-08-19 02:56:01', '', 4240, 'https://astcc.asia/4240-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4563, 1, '2022-08-19 10:56:13', '2022-08-19 02:56:13', '10月20日僑委會童振源委員長、謝世英國策顧問及亞總江福龍總會長一同前往智利會舘拜會中南美洲李訓銘總會長<!--more--><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e7%ab%a5%e6%8c%af%e6%ba%90%e5%a7%94%e5%93%a1%e9%95%b7%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e4%b8%ad%e5%8d%97%e7%be%8e%e6%b4%b2%e6%9d%8e%e8%a8%93%e9%8a%98%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7/%e5%a7%94%e5%93%a1%e9%95%b7%e8%87%b3%e6%99%ba%e5%88%a9%e6%9c%83%e9%a4%a8/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4236\">\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-4236 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/委員長至智利會館.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e7%ab%a5%e6%8c%af%e6%ba%90%e5%a7%94%e5%93%a1%e9%95%b7%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e4%b8%ad%e5%8d%97%e7%be%8e%e6%b4%b2%e6%9d%8e%e8%a8%93%e9%8a%98%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7/%e5%a7%94%e5%93%a1%e9%95%b7%e8%87%b3%e6%99%ba%e5%88%a9%e6%9c%83%e9%a4%a82/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4237\"><img class=\"size-full wp-image-4237 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/委員長至智利會館2.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></a>', '僑委會童振源委員長拜會中南美洲李訓銘總會長', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4235-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:56:13', '2022-08-19 02:56:13', '', 4235, 'https://astcc.asia/4235-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
