(4565, 1, '2022-08-19 10:56:50', '2022-08-19 02:56:50', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">今天是中華民國110年國慶日，在疫情肆虐全球的這兩年中，各國皆陷入困境，台灣也在今年本土疫情爆發後實施嚴格防疫措施，台灣不但在防疫上表現出堅強的韌性，也透過奧運等國際活動，以及台灣在各種產業供應鏈的重要性與代表性，讓更多人看見台灣，在疫情之下向世界展現更高的價值。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">中華民國，雙十節快樂！</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e3%80%90%e5%9c%8b%e6%85%b6%e9%9b%99%e5%8d%81%e3%80%91/%e5%9c%8b%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4225\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4225\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/國慶.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"321\" height=\"454\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n', '【國慶雙十】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4224-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:56:50', '2022-08-19 02:56:50', '', 4224, 'https://astcc.asia/4224-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4567, 1, '2022-08-19 10:57:18', '2022-08-19 02:57:18', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">世界台灣商會聯合總會拜會立法院世界臺商之友會 就海外臺商關切議題交流。</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">詳見新聞：</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Focacnews.net%2Farticle%2F291661%3Ffbclid%3DIwAR1O3JIhe0f3oIw03W4-jtOiURmXFrr62bk021yDzDe8Uqn4XyF37wlTdYo&amp;h=AT3O1ksD4TlPMuLdRh2YmKM7CfZLaQE_ptUawiwTnuGaQrYd_3eizwTwOFj3m_dCuQ72Mu2-jhRZYofaVs8pPA_6w4AAlZXCw8SKYbhHv9PMtvrd9xrErDYrI5_frWM10oPE&amp;__tn__=-UK-R&amp;c[0]=AT1R54eWJVx0rwL_xNCTI9EWaOYxHSUXqmUC1l32X07bZ5fR28UkiT7N2rA2_OUVBLD-l9qoFyMb9SOKCOrAxEy03ugNuigUMJKA2-R6NoW_vesgQuBGKbFxZczO788KFpKVNPGxoE0ea-dGEVddxWZYlxsYhAlxbsK73AqRS9iWf-LK2wbttuDgCWJrT1bs5FQZz5tm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://ocacnews.net/article/291661</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%b8%96%e7%95%8c%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e7%ab%8b%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2%e4%b8%96%e7%95%8c%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e4%b9%8b%e5%8f%8b%e6%9c%83/%e4%b8%96%e7%b8%bd%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e7%ab%8b%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4212\"><img class=\"wp-image-4212 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/世總拜會立法院.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '世界台灣商會聯合總會拜會立法院世界臺商之友會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4211-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:57:18', '2022-08-19 02:57:18', '', 4211, 'https://astcc.asia/4211-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4568, 1, '2022-08-19 10:57:34', '2022-08-19 02:57:34', '<div dir=\"auto\">本總會參與世界台灣商會聯合總會第廿七屆年會</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">今年因受疫情、防疫規定影響，舉辦活動場地及參與人數受限，但世界台灣商會聯合總會克服萬難，於9月27、28日在台北圓山大飯店舉辦第廿七屆年會、理監事會議、交接典禮及開閉幕儀式，本總會江福龍總會長率領理監事及青商代表參與此盛事。</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%b8%96%e7%95%8c%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e7%ac%ac27%e5%b1%86%e5%b9%b4%e6%9c%83/%e4%b8%96%e7%b8%bd27-3-1/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4206\"><img class=\"wp-image-4206 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/世總27-3-1-700x447.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"319\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%b8%96%e7%95%8c%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e7%ac%ac27%e5%b1%86%e5%b9%b4%e6%9c%83/%e4%b8%96%e7%b8%bd27-3-2/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4207\"><img class=\"wp-image-4207 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/世總27-3-2-700x462.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"330\" /></a></div>', '世界台灣商會聯合總會第27屆年會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4205-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:57:34', '2022-08-19 02:57:34', '', 4205, 'https://astcc.asia/4205-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4569, 1, '2022-08-19 10:57:48', '2022-08-19 02:57:48', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">中南美洲台灣商會聯合總會9月25日於臺中智利會所召開第27屆第2次理監事會議，僑委會副委員長徐佳青、立法委員黃國書、世界台灣商會聯合總會總會長梁輝騰、下(28)屆總會長王德、第29屆總會長黃行德、名譽總會長連元章、中南美洲輔導總會長張崇斌、非洲總會長吳孟宗及本會(亞總)總會長江福龍、輔導總會長劉樹添等多位台商貴賓出席。</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">相關連結</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://ocacnews.net/article/291262?fbclid=IwAR28u5QDZwAoayb9CV-WsY49Box1b2Wi8LsW06va4wBXMOg-Rxt9lfLYgnk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://ocacnews.net/article/291262</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%b8%ad%e5%8d%97%e7%be%8e%e6%b4%b2%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e7%ac%ac27%e5%b1%86%e7%ac%ac2%e6%ac%a1%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0/%e4%b8%ad%e5%8d%97%e7%be%8e27/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4202\"><img class=\"wp-image-4202 aligncenter\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/中南美27.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"500\" height=\"281\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '中南美洲台灣商會聯合總會第27屆第2次理監事會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4201-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:57:48', '2022-08-19 02:57:48', '', 4201, 'https://astcc.asia/4201-revision-v1/', 0, 