(4571, 1, '2022-08-19 10:58:15', '2022-08-19 02:58:15', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">年年圓滿如意，月月事事順心，日日喜悅無憂，時時高興歡喜，刻刻充滿朝氣，月圓人圓花好，事順業順家興!</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲台商會祝您中秋佳節愉快！</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e7%a5%9d%e6%82%a8%e4%b8%ad%e7%a7%8b%e4%bd%b3%e7%af%80%e6%84%89%e5%bf%ab%ef%bc%81/%e4%b8%ad%e7%a7%8b%e7%af%80/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4192\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4192\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/中秋節.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"321\" height=\"451\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '亞洲台商會祝您中秋佳節愉快！', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4191-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:58:15', '2022-08-19 02:58:15', '', 4191, 'https://astcc.asia/4191-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4572, 1, '2022-08-19 10:58:34', '2022-08-19 02:58:34', '<div class=\"kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">9/8農業金融研討會</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">分享和檢討農業金融體系的相關業務成效、評估成立新業務的必要性，彙整各方意見，研提具體建議，作為未來工作推動參考。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">研討會分為四大主題：</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">「農業貸款暨資訊整合」、「農業保險和農民退休儲金」、「農業創投」、「農業金融創新」。</div>\r\n</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">主辦單位：全國農業金庫</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">指導單位：行政院農業委員會</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">協辦單位：中央畜產會、中華民國太陽光電發電系統同業公會、中華民國四健會協會、中華民 國全國漁會、中華民國農會、中興大學國際產學聯盟、台灣飼料工業同業公會、台灣農村經濟學會、亞洲台灣商會聯合總會、農業信用保證基金(筆畫序)</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新聞連結分享</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a class=\"oajrlxb2 g5ia77u1 qu0x051f esr5mh6w e9989ue4 r7d6kgcz rq0escxv nhd2j8a9 nc684nl6 p7hjln8o kvgmc6g5 cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x jb3vyjys rz4wbd8a qt6c0cv9 a8nywdso i1ao9s8h esuyzwwr f1sip0of lzcic4wl py34i1dx gpro0wi8\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://money.udn.com/money/story/5635/5734791?fbclid=IwAR17dF2HB74sTs44GV6ViQhk7M26OL-GJkAVYhfJRfXcYYPfJ2MQcSSLPc0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://money.udn.com/money/story/5635/5734791</a></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e8%be%b2%e6%a5%ad%e9%87%91%e8%9e%8d%e7%a0%94%e8%a8%8e%e6%9c%83/%e8%be%b2%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%831/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4185\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4185\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/農委會1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"396\" height=\"218\" /></a> <a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e8%be%b2%e6%a5%ad%e9%87%91%e8%9e%8d%e7%a0%94%e8%a8%8e%e6%9c%83/%e8%be%b2%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%832/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4187\"><img class=\"alignnone wp-image-4187\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/農委會2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"337\" height=\"253\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '農業金融研討會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4184-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:58:34', '2022-08-19 02:58:34', '', 4184, 'https://astcc.asia/4184-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(4573, 1, '2022-08-19 10:58:49', '2022-08-19 02:58:49', '<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">每一句心語，都是濃濃的思念和深深的祝福，送你溫暖與喜悅，無論你在何方，願情誼永存。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"o9v6fnle cxmmr5t8 oygrvhab hcukyx3x c1et5uql ii04i59q\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲台商總會祝您：七夕情人節快樂！</div><!--more-->\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://astcc.asia/%e4%b8%83%e5%a4%95%e6%83%85%e4%ba%ba%e7%af%80%e5%bf%ab%e6%a8%82%ef%bc%81/%e4%b8%83%e5%a4%95/\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-4178\"><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-4178\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2021/10/七夕-250x409.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"276\" height=\"451\" /></a></div>\r\n</div>', '七夕情人節快樂！', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '4177-revision-v1', '', '', '2022-08-19 10:58:49', '2022-08-19 02:58:49', '', 4177, 'https://astcc.asia/4177-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
