(5611, 7, '2023-12-01 12:00:17', '2023-12-01 04:00:17', '狂賀‼️‼️\r\n2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，獲獎率達93%，獲獎總成績更拿下本屆總冠軍🏆\r\n阿聯酋台商會陳豪霆會長與勞動部許銘春部長一起用餐慶祝！🎉🎉\r\n亞總許玉林總會長今年到杜拜幫組阿聯酋台商會😁😁這是阿聯酋台商會第一次正式公開參與活動，為台灣選手加油打氣💪🏻！\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5622\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__12419128.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5623\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003995_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5624\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003997_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5625\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003998_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />', '捷報快訊📢2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，總成績拿下本屆總冠軍🏆', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%8d%b7%e5%a0%b1%e5%bf%ab%e8%a8%8a%f0%9f%93%a22023%e9%98%bf%e5%b8%83%e9%81%94%e6%af%94%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2%e6%8a%80%e8%83%bd%e7%ab%b6%e8%b3%bd%ef%bc%8c%e8%87%ba%e7%81%a3%e6%8a%80%e8%83%bd%e8%8b%b1', '', '', '2024-07-29 14:43:43', '2024-07-29 06:43:43', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=5611', 0, 'post', '', 0),
