(5627, 7, '2023-12-01 13:09:12', '2023-12-01 05:09:12', '狂賀‼️‼️\r\n2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，獲獎率達93%，獲獎總成績更拿下本屆總冠軍🏆\r\n阿聯酋台商會陳豪霆會長與勞動部許銘春部長一起用餐慶祝！🎉🎉\r\n亞總許玉林總會長今年到杜拜幫組阿聯酋台商會😁😁這是阿聯酋台商會第一次正式公開參與活動，為台灣選手加油打氣💪🏻！\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__12419128.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5622\" width=\"640\"/>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003995_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5623\" width=\"640\"/>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003997_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5624\" width=\"640\"/>\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003998_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5625\" width=\"640\"/>', '捷報快訊📢2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，總成績拿下本屆總冠軍🏆', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5611-revision-v1', '', '', '2023-12-01 13:09:12', '2023-12-01 05:09:12', '', 5611, 'https://astcc.asia/5611-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
