(5779, 7, '2024-07-22 15:59:19', '2024-07-22 07:59:19', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n📌15日開幕典禮📌\r\n🎊副總統蕭美琴\r\n🎊立法副院長江啟臣\r\n🎊僑委會主委徐佳青\r\n🎊台中市長盧秀燕\r\n🎊雲林縣長張麗善等蒞臨祝賀\r\n\r\n與會台商餘千名✨場面熱絡非凡\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3189_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3183_0_0.jpg\" width=\"564\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3185_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3192_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3188_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3182_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3187_0_0.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3186_0_0.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"374\" />', '📌15日開幕典禮📌', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%f0%9f%93%8c15%e6%97%a5%e9%96%8b%e5%b9%95%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae%f0%9f%93%8c', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:22:20', '2024-07-29 03:22:20', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=5779', 0, 'post', '', 0),
