(5789, 7, '2024-07-23 13:38:41', '2024-07-23 05:38:41', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n【立法院晚宴】\r\n會議進行至第二日，立法院晚宴設宴於台中林酒店。\r\n\r\n💪立法院副院長江啟臣\r\n💪雲林縣副縣長謝淑亞\r\n\r\n與各國台商齊聚同樂🎆\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585805_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585811_0.jpg\" width=\"393\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585810_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585809_0.jpg\" width=\"391\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585808_0.jpg\" width=\"389\" height=\"292\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585807_0.jpg\" width=\"388\" height=\"291\" />', '【立法院晚宴】', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e3%80%90%e7%ab%8b%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2%e6%99%9a%e5%ae%b4%e3%80%91', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:29:19', '2024-07-29 03:29:19', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=5789', 0, 'post', '', 0),
