(5796, 7, '2024-07-23 11:56:33', '2024-07-23 03:56:33', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n【立法院晚宴】\r\n會議進行至第二日，立法院晚宴設宴於台中林酒店。\r\n\r\n💪立法院副院長江啟臣\r\n💪雲林縣副縣長謝淑亞\r\n\r\n與各國台商齊聚同樂🎆\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585805_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585811_0.jpg\" width=\"393\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585810_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585809_0.jpg\" width=\"391\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585808_0.jpg\" width=\"389\" height=\"292\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585807_0.jpg\" width=\"388\" height=\"291\" />', '【立法院晚宴】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5789-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-23 11:56:33', '2024-07-23 03:56:33', '', 5789, 'https://astcc.asia/5789-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5799, 10, '2024-07-29 11:21:10', '2024-07-29 03:21:10', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\n\n【立法院晚宴】\n會議進行至第二日，立法院晚宴設宴於台中林酒店。\n\n💪立法院副院長江啟臣\n💪雲林縣副縣長謝淑亞\n\n與各國台商齊聚同樂🎆\n\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\n\n<!--more-->\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585805_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"295\" />\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585811_0.jpg\" width=\"393\" height=\"295\" />\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585810_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\" />\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585809_0.jpg\" width=\"391\" height=\"294\" />\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585808_0.jpg\" width=\"389\" height=\"292\" />\n\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585807_0.jpg\" width=\"388\" height=\"291\" />', '【立法院晚宴】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5789-autosave-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:21:10', '2024-07-29 03:21:10', '', 5789, 'https://astcc.asia/5789-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5800, 10, '2024-07-29 11:21:17', '2024-07-29 03:21:17', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n【立法院晚宴】\r\n會議進行至第二日，立法院晚宴設宴於台中林酒店。\r\n\r\n💪立法院副院長江啟臣\r\n💪雲林縣副縣長謝淑亞\r\n\r\n與各國台商齊聚同樂🎆\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585805_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585811_0.jpg\" width=\"393\" height=\"295\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585810_0.jpg\" width=\"392\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585809_0.jpg\" width=\"391\" height=\"294\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585808_0.jpg\" width=\"389\" height=\"292\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7585807_0.jpg\" width=\"388\" height=\"291\" />', '【立法院晚宴】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5789-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:21:17', '2024-07-29 03:21:17', '', 5789, 'https://astcc.asia/5789-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5801, 10, '2024-07-29 11:22:20', '2024-07-29 03:22:20', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n📌15日開幕典禮📌\r\n🎊副總統蕭美琴\r\n🎊立法副院長江啟臣\r\n🎊僑委會主委徐佳青\r\n🎊台中市長盧秀燕\r\n🎊雲林縣長張麗善等蒞臨祝賀\r\n\r\n與會台商餘千名✨場面熱絡非凡\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3189_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3183_0_0.jpg\" width=\"564\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3185_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3192_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"376\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3188_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3182_0_0.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3187_0_0.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"375\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/3186_0_0.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"374\" />', '📌15日開幕典禮📌', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5779-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:22:20', '2024-07-29 03:22:20', '', 5779, 'https://astcc.asia/5779-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5802, 10, '2024-07-29 11:22:58', '2024-07-29 03:22:58', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n【首日歡迎晚宴】\r\n本屆亞總會議首日歡迎晚宴\r\n設宴於台中林酒店。\r\n台中市政府、新竹市政府及\r\n多位立法委員到席㊗️賀。\r\n🪭\r\n各國台商齊聚同樂，\r\n現場氣氛活躍，\r\n為本次會議揭開序幕📣📣📣\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500283_0_0.jpg\" width=\"478\" height=\"359\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500582_01_0.jpg\" width=\"478\" height=\"637\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500583_0_0.jpg\" width=\"478\" height=\"636\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500584_0_0.jpg\" width=\"477\" height=\"358\" />', '【首日歡迎晚宴】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5777-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:22:58', '2024-07-29 03:22:58', '', 5777, 'https://astcc.asia/5777-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5803, 10, '2024-07-29 11:23:14', '2024-07-29 03:23:14', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n【凝聚青年力量，共創未來】\r\n為強化亞洲青年在國際的影響力，本屆會議同時舉辦亞洲台灣商會聯合總會青商會相關會議。邀請來自各地的亞總青年齊聚一堂：交流經驗、凝聚共識，共同為亞總的未來發展注入活水。\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會 #亞青\r\n會議中除回顧亞青過去一年之工作成果，包括舉辦活動、推動青年創業、爭取國際曝光等來為未來發展奠定基礎。並進一步討論亞青未來發展方向，包括拓展國際合作、強化組織運作等，旨在凝聚亞青會員共識，促進彼此交流，建立人脈，用團結力量向前邁進。當日也選出新任理監事，帶領亞青邁向新里程。🚩\r\n#第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500219_0_0.jpg\" width=\"502\" height=\"377\" />\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500245_0_0.jpg\" width=\"502\" height=\"669\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500242_0_0.jpg\" width=\"501\" height=\"667\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/500567_0_0.jpg\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\" />', '【凝聚青年力量，共創未來】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5767-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:23:14', '2024-07-29 03:23:14', '', 5767, 'https://astcc.asia/5767-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5804, 10, '2024-07-29 11:23:57', '2024-07-29 03:23:57', '#連結亞洲共好台灣\r\n\r\n【活動第一日的重大議程】\r\n✒️常務理事會議\r\n✒️監事會議\r\n\r\n分別由許玉林總會長（右二）及兪秀霞監事長（左一）主持，幹部就組織內部事務進行報告，會議中提出多項提議進行討論與覆議。\r\n\r\n#31th亞總 #亞洲台灣商會聯合總會 #第三十一屆第三次理監事聯席會議\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7569592_1_0-scaled.jpg\" width=\"560\" height=\"420\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7569593_0_0-scaled.jpg\" width=\"564\" height=\"423\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/S__7569590_0_0-scaled.jpg\" width=\"563\" height=\"422\" />', '【活動第一日的重大議程】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5762-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:23:57', '2024-07-29 03:23:57', '', 5762, 'https://astcc.asia/5762-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5805, 10, '2024-07-29 11:25:25', '2024-07-29 03:25:25', '狂賀‼️‼️\r\n2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，獲獎率達93%，獲獎總成績更拿下本屆總冠軍🏆\r\n阿聯酋台商會陳豪霆會長與勞動部許銘春部長一起用餐慶祝！🎉🎉\r\n亞總許玉林總會長今年到杜拜幫組阿聯酋台商會😁😁這是阿聯酋台商會第一次正式公開參與活動，為台灣選手加油打氣💪🏻！\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5622\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__12419128.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5623\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003995_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5624\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003997_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5625\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003998_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />', '捷報快訊📢2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，總成績拿下本屆總冠軍🏆', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5611-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:25:25', '2024-07-29 03:25:25', '', 5611, 'https://astcc.asia/5611-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(5806, 10, '2024-07-29 11:27:02', '2024-07-29 03:27:02', '狂賀‼️‼️\r\n2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，獲獎率達93%，獲獎總成績更拿下本屆總冠軍🏆\r\n阿聯酋台商會陳豪霆會長與勞動部許銘春部長一起用餐慶祝！🎉🎉\r\n亞總許玉林總會長今年到杜拜幫組阿聯酋台商會😁😁這是阿聯酋台商會第一次正式公開參與活動，為台灣選手加油打氣💪🏻！\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5622\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__12419128.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5623\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003995_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5624\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003997_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-5625\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/S__50003998_0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"640\" />', '捷報快訊📢2023阿布達比亞洲技能競賽，臺灣技能英雄勇奪12金6銀4銅3優勝，總成績拿下本屆總冠軍🏆', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '5611-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-07-29 11:27:02', '2024-07-29 03:27:02', '', 5611, 'https://astcc.asia/5611-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
