(5833, 10, '2024-07-29 14:27:54', '2024-07-29 06:27:54', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">7月16日舉辦第32屆總會長、監事長政見發表暨投票選舉，在選委會嚴謹的規劃及監督下，所有理監事遵循規範及秩序，投下神聖一票。第32屆林凱民總會長、吳國本監事長眾望所歸，高票當選。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">選後隨即進行閉幕典禮及交接儀式，在亞洲台灣商會聯合總會青商會第13、14屆會長及監事長交接儀式後，由行政院長卓榮泰、僑委會徐佳青委員長、世總李天柒總會長共同擔任第31、32屆總會長及監事長交接儀式的見證人。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5834\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452145485_476662581675916_9177379318316885953_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5835\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452214043_476662785009229_8301993814826797117_n-250x180.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5836\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452106168_476662668342574_1072908525698009380_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5837\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452129126_476662821675892_2828692238361154044_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5838\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452143938_476662718342569_2654038463646353139_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5839\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/452148676_476662705009237_9147558400131860367_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5840\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/450931208_1065715144923627_6202440072155739446_n-1-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5841\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/451449978_1065715224923619_6042445743035193132_n-1-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-med