(6011, 10, '2024-08-07 17:08:34', '2024-08-07 09:08:34', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">【關島台商會宴請國立中興大學流浪動物義診團】</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">國立中興大學獸醫學系義診團赴關島推動「島嶼寵物節育計畫」，協助解決當地流浪犬貓問題。7月29日 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz x1sur9pj xkrqix3 x1fey0fg xo1l8bm\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/hashtag/%E9%97%9C%E5%B3%B6%E5%8F%B0%E5%95%86%E6%9C%83%E8%99%9E%E7%8E%8B%E5%88%A9%E8%8B%B1%E6%9C%83%E9%95%B7?__eep__=6&amp;__cft__[0]=AZXUfFoZjCqXRK7RXzQOIh7IreHPDfOlgPDmKiTWbmEGCGjGEM0127v64n2Ir4K6A5Lm0lhau31ArXye54-CgFuLdt_ivlnGk6NvjhliVF6bJCoOn55xehPGi549FqCe8h9TYUew2AE4RisQqn365-S9iLrKg66IE2YsGSB-B7bQqGV9x6zCcXEzAYpFBUx4ojIgc9t90jxChxOtlKdnQyEb&amp;__tn__=*NK-R\">#關島台商會虞王利英會長</a></span> 在凱悅酒店 Guam Hyatt Regency Hotel宴請該團劉品辰教授和 吳怡珣獸醫師，關島大學亞太區大學聯盟資深聯絡主任陳冠儒、副主任劉正宏及關島台北文化經濟辦事處盧啟章副組長和葉仁傑領事也受邀與會。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6012\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/453263634_481639594511548_5494743580447519613_n-250x186.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '關島台商會宴請國立中興大學流浪動物義診團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%97%9c%e5%b3%b6%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e5%ae%b4%e8%ab%8b%e5%9c%8b%e7%ab%8b%e4%b8%ad%e8%88%88%e5%a4%a7%e5%ad%b8%e6%b5%81%e6%b5%aa%e5%8b%95%e7%89%a9%e7%be%a9%e8%a8%ba%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2024-08-07 17:27:30', '2024-08-07 09:27:30', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6011', 0, 'post', '', 0),
