(6214, 10, '2024-10-31 16:50:56', '2024-10-31 08:50:56', '本會總會長林凱民及輔導總會長許玉於8月22日帶隊拜訪AMATA集團位於曼谷的總部中心，該集團介紹與中興工程顧問公司合作開發的「台北智慧城」，盼吸引更多台商進駐，雙方並分享亞洲各國投資環境，進行多項討論交流。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6215\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456954378_498884709453703_669239533105169772_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6216\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456793501_498884682787039_931533761956496887_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6217\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456985469_498884722787035_3670536201142767047_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6218\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456997811_498884702787037_3203205001646607722_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總拜會AMATA集團總部', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83amata%e9%9b%86%e5%9c%98%e7%b8%bd%e9%83%a8', '', '', '2024-10-31 18:00:37', '2024-10-31 10:00:37', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6214', 0, 'post', '', 0),
