(6219, 10, '2024-10-31 16:50:56', '2024-10-31 08:50:56', '本會總會長林凱民及輔導總會長許玉於8月22日帶隊拜訪AMATA集團位於曼谷的總部中心，該集團介紹與中興工程顧問公司合作開發的「台北智慧城」，盼吸引更多台商進駐，雙方並分享亞洲各國投資環境，進行多項討論交流。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6215\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456954378_498884709453703_669239533105169772_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6216\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456793501_498884682787039_931533761956496887_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6217\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456985469_498884722787035_3670536201142767047_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6218\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/456997811_498884702787037_3203205001646607722_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總拜會AMATA集團總部', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6214-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 16:50:56', '2024-10-31 08:50:56', '', 6214, 'https://astcc.asia/6214-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6220, 10, '2024-10-31 16:56:55', '2024-10-31 08:56:55', '8月23日本會總會長林凱民偕同輔導總會長 許玉林率領副祕書長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">賴俊宏、</span><span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林宇馨</span>、青商會監事長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">許絜茹</span>及資深理事<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">楊博鈞</span> 、<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">梁乙元</span>等一行正式拜會駐泰國台北經濟文化辦事處，由<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">張俊福</span>大使、僑務組及經濟組同仁與會參與，會面期間，張大使分享泰國當地目前的經濟狀況、政治發展及投資政策等。總會長談及未來將繼續協助提升台灣的競爭力及能見度，全力整合各方資源並結合起來提供更好的發展。結束後，於現場彼此贈送紀念品。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6224\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457466260_501186115890229_6047710259274003672_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6222\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457264246_501186012556906_4323613017910056629_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6225\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457470884_501186095890231_1132652888782795657_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6221\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457257102_501186039223570_2113879685455524330_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6226\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457690255_501186069223567_44726432038630715_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6223\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457369152_501186109223563_4676328033918803045_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總拜會駐泰代表處', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e6%8b%9c%e6%9c%83%e9%a7%90%e6%b3%b0%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e8%99%95', '', '', '2024-10-31 18:00:30', '2024-10-31 10:00:30', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6220', 0, 'post', '', 0),
