(6235, 10, '2024-10-31 17:01:34', '2024-10-31 09:01:34', '於8月24日上午本會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span>、名譽總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">賴維信</span>偕同世界台灣商會聯合總會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">李天柒</span>率團專程前往訪視泰國台灣商會聯合總會，與本會創會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">余聲清</span>、名譽總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">劉樹添</span>及該國總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳漢川</span>、及多位當地僑領共敘情誼，就亞總會務進行報告及交流。林總會長並鄭重邀請與會者參加本屆即將於馬來西亞吉隆坡舉辦的第二次理監事會議，本會秘書長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">康耀忠</span>及副祕書長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林宇馨</span>亦隨行參與，現場氣氛歡樂融洽。結束後，進行午餐餐敘。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6230\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457243694_501188342556673_853249453084642231_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6233\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457278663_501188309223343_3196633210515721638_n-250x114.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6229\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457228034_501188522556655_2314042394081065986_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6231\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457257296_501188539223320_8515740437178877841_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6232\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457259519_501188605889980_8621937445514021621_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />  <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6234\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/457467916_501188495889991_523536674633808179_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '訪視泰國台灣商會聯合總會', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6228-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:01:34', '2024-10-31 09:01:34', '', 6228, 'https://astcc.asia/6228-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6236, 10, '2024-10-31 17:05:35', '2024-10-31 09:05:35', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">今年適逢台帛建交25週年，響應外交部的「榮邦計畫」經由外交部協助及配合帛琉政府、帛琉商會邀請，「亞總帛琉投資考察團」成行，<!--more--></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">由世界台灣商會聯合總會總會長李天柒擔任總團長、本會總會長林凱民擔任團長組團共28人，包含立法委員羅美玲、本會監事長吳國本及副總會長東鄉清龍、北美洲台商總會總會長江俊霖及來自不同國家的成員，為示重視，外交部指派王韋龍副總領事回部辦事陪同訪帛。一行人在9月2日一早於桃園機場集合出發前往帛琉，展開為期四天的此行目的在於考察當地商機貿易 ，促進經貿合作關係。抵達帛琉機場即受到熱烈歡迎，駐帛琉大使館公使陳豐裕偕羅浩瑋秘書、帛琉商會及帛琉台灣商會代表前往接機。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n當晚帛琉政府設宴盛情招待訪團，由席嫵杜副總統代表宴請訪團，席總統致詞時竭誠歡迎亞總率投資考察團訪問帛琉，相信這是台帛建交25週年里程碑的最佳見證，除了將為帛琉帶來更多的投資機會外，也將更深化兩國的關係。林總會長在致詞時也表達透過投資以及商務往來支持台帛邦交的行動力。\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6241\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458943017_507526841922823_5454624321347545140_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6242\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458998329_507152581960249_447212578938761269_n-250x166.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6239\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458742440_507152781960229_5965685256202030979_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6243\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459113183_507524901923017_3492078130086604653_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6238\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458689930_507524868589687_460704861186520546_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6237\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458630929_507153135293527_605624045345709465_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />   <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6240\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458935428_507153141960193_676038376707286345_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總帛琉投資考察團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2024-10-31 18:00:15', '2024-10-31 10:00:15', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6236', 0, 'post', '', 0),
