(6255, 10, '2024-10-31 17:11:59', '2024-10-31 09:11:59', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總帛琉投資考察團於9月3日上午由帛琉總統惠恕仁親自接見，惠總統表達深度肯定此團，期許未來繼續交流合作，創造豐碩投資成果。在圓桌論壇中眾議院議長、參議院議長、副總統、財務部長、外交部長、人力資源部長、教育部長、帛琉駐台大使、多位州長及產業代表包含港口、電力、銀行及油製品等多位出席。駐帛琉大使黎倩儀陪同，世總總會長李天柒表示將會將此行成果報告給世界的成員，促進更多商機合作。羅美玲立委則希望彼此學習，增進台帛的友好關係。而林凱民總會長介紹此團成員跨足不同產業包含農業、漁業、旅遊業等，共同考察投資帛琉的商機，並為慶祝台帛建交25週年捐贈美金兩萬元予帛琉政府，由惠總統代表受贈。我方團員另就帛琉旅館整建並引進國際連鎖品牌、協助帛琉發展對外航線及郵輪、引進免稅商店、增加帛琉太陽能光電之儲能系統、海鹽、漁飼料生產及土地開發等，熱烈與惠總統及帛琉官員交換意見。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">帛琉政府並特別準備投資說明關於現今的稅務系統及未來展望，建議可投資的類別，會談後團員們參觀宏偉的國會大廈。結束後前往美麗丘州政府，接受北大酋Reklai午宴款待，享用當地傳統美食。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6252\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458934049_507185248623649_3753564745070947718_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6246\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458635195_507185385290302_1784819733876705774_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6247\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458640757_507185288623645_2704156091385946129_n-250x178.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6253\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458972141_507185285290312_1275352599868458142_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6251\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458772470_507185465290294_4684942983065757727_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6254\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459148901_507185345290306_2848096970783511919_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6250\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458772457_507185498623624_8489007145234433480_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6248\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458734132_507185528623621_508105529574116465_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6249\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458766732_507185525290288_6020842972008624994_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞總帛琉投資考察團晉見帛琉總統', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6245-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:11:59', '2024-10-31 09:11:59', '', 6245, 'https://astcc.asia/6245-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6256, 10, '2024-10-31 17:13:56', '2024-10-31 09:13:56', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總帛琉投資考察團於9月3日上午由帛琉總統惠恕仁親自接見，惠總統表達深度肯定此團，期許未來繼續交流合作，創造豐碩投資成果。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">在圓桌論壇中眾議院議長、參議院議長、副總統、財務部長、外交部長、人力資源部長、教育部長、帛琉駐台大使、多位州長及產業代表包含港口、電力、銀行及油製品等多位出席。駐帛琉大使黎倩儀陪同，世總總會長李天柒表示將會將此行成果報告給世界的成員，促進更多商機合作。羅美玲立委則希望彼此學習，增進台帛的友好關係。而林凱民總會長介紹此團成員跨足不同產業包含農業、漁業、旅遊業等，共同考察投資帛琉的商機，並為慶祝台帛建交25週年捐贈美金兩萬元予帛琉政府，由惠總統代表受贈。我方團員另就帛琉旅館整建並引進國際連鎖品牌、協助帛琉發展對外航線及郵輪、引進免稅商店、增加帛琉太陽能光電之儲能系統、海鹽、漁飼料生產及土地開發等，熱烈與惠總統及帛琉官員交換意見。帛琉政府並特別準備投資說明關於現今的稅務系統及未來展望，建議可投資的類別，會談後團員們參觀宏偉的國會大廈。結束後前往美麗丘州政府，接受北大酋Reklai午宴款待，享用當地傳統美食。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6252\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458934049_507185248623649_3753564745070947718_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6246\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458635195_507185385290302_1784819733876705774_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6247\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458640757_507185288623645_2704156091385946129_n-250x178.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6253\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458972141_507185285290312_1275352599868458142_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6251\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458772470_507185465290294_4684942983065757727_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6254\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459148901_507185345290306_2848096970783511919_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6250\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458772457_507185498623624_8489007145234433480_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6248\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458734132_507185528623621_508105529574116465_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6249\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458766732_507185525290288_6020842972008624994_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞總帛琉投資考察團晉見帛琉總統', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6245-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:13:56', '2024-10-31 09:13:56', '', 6245, 'https://astcc.asia/6245-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6257, 10, '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '在駐帛琉大使黎倩儀及帛琉商會會長的陪同之下，亞總帛琉投資考察團於9月3日下午參觀帛琉國家水產中心，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n此為台灣政府派駐研究員協助帛琉國家水產中心提升運作效率，包括改善微藻培養、飼料儲藏、增加種魚與魚苗培育面積及計畫管理辦公空間。\r\n結束後參加駐帛琉黎倩儀大使晚宴，財政部長、國務部長、人力資源文化觀光部長MHRCT、帛琉商會會長等當地政府官員及在地台商會員應邀出席，現場歡笑不斷，氣氛熱絡。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6259\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458707666_507208218621352_4347689459743859020_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6260\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458759603_507208565287984_3374955969812933090_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6264\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459139203_507208578621316_5315998452183016164_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6263\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458964142_507208511954656_8620068213423054319_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6261\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458764298_507208255288015_5679694552466687973_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6262\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458962510_507208385288002_9059233916645283382_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6258\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458666881_507208305288010_3374623539464700597_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總帛琉投資考察團參觀帛琉國家水產中心', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e6%8a%95%e8%b3%87%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f%e5%9c%98%e5%8f%83%e8%a7%80%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%b6%e6%b0%b4%e7%94%a2%e4%b8%ad%e5%bf%83', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6257', 0, 'post', '', 0),
