(6265, 10, '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '在駐帛琉大使黎倩儀及帛琉商會會長的陪同之下，亞總帛琉投資考察團於9月3日下午參觀帛琉國家水產中心，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n此為台灣政府派駐研究員協助帛琉國家水產中心提升運作效率，包括改善微藻培養、飼料儲藏、增加種魚與魚苗培育面積及計畫管理辦公空間。\r\n結束後參加駐帛琉黎倩儀大使晚宴，財政部長、國務部長、人力資源文化觀光部長MHRCT、帛琉商會會長等當地政府官員及在地台商會員應邀出席，現場歡笑不斷，氣氛熱絡。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6259\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458707666_507208218621352_4347689459743859020_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6260\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458759603_507208565287984_3374955969812933090_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6264\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459139203_507208578621316_5315998452183016164_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6263\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458964142_507208511954656_8620068213423054319_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6261\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458764298_507208255288015_5679694552466687973_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6262\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458962510_507208385288002_9059233916645283382_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6258\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458666881_507208305288010_3374623539464700597_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總帛琉投資考察團參觀帛琉國家水產中心', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6257-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:17:16', '2024-10-31 09:17:16', '', 6257, 'https://astcc.asia/6257-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6266, 10, '2024-10-31 17:20:13', '2024-10-31 09:20:13', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總帛琉投資考察團9月4日應邀前往帛琉16州之一的艾來州 (Airai) 接受州長協會的晚宴款待，在開始前先參觀了目前唯一仍在使用的「男人會館」Abai House，為原住民男人早期的集會場所，以了解當地歷史文化。一進晚宴現場即受到熱烈的列隊歡迎，與會來賓包含州長、帛琉駐台大使等。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">州長Delegate Kanai 致詞間穿插台語及中文語句，展現對台灣的友好，駐帛琉大使黎儀倩則表示海外台人遍佈世界六大洲，深耕當地，不僅繁榮地方且創造就業機會，盼未來進一步拓展合作機會。林凱民總會長則讚賞帛琉豐富之文化旅遊資源，而在經貿領域，將建立互利共贏的合作機會。享用當地佳餚，席間觀賞傳統舞蹈表演，展現帛琉風情，並以卡拉OK 同樂，賓主盡歡。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6268\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458703525_507563625252478_4827036636016637655_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6269\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458764730_507563605252480_4092187063617423659_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6270\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/458772234_507563641919143_2566343115683194445_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6271\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459031956_507563631919144_7982545894828164188_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6272\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/459149799_507563585252482_4426955788375898160_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總帛琉投資考察團參加艾來州 (Airai) 州長協會晚宴', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '6266-2', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:21:35', '2024-10-31 09:21:35', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6266', 0, 'post', '', 0),
