(6305, 10, '2024-10-31 17:41:40', '2024-10-31 09:41:40', '9月25日上午亞總團隊拜會屏東縣政府，由縣長周春米親自接待。期待各國後續與屏東有更多產業合作的機會，讓世界看見屏東。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6303\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461480751_521767463832094_4264478287615336831_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總團隊拜會屏東縣政府', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6302-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-10-31 17:41:40', '2024-10-31 09:41:40', '', 6302, 'https://astcc.asia/6302-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6306, 10, '2024-10-31 17:44:22', '2024-10-31 09:44:22', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">世界台灣商會聯合總會第三十一屆</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8d/1/16/2611.png\" alt=\"☑️\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>總會長、監事長、副總會長、副監事長暨新任理監事宣誓儀式</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8d/1/16/2611.png\" alt=\"☑️\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>第一次理監事聯席會議</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6313\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461712644_522223317119842_4935220906016067981_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6307\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461446348_522223420453165_6793245203322555424_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6309\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461458358_522223367119837_9005450976958953202_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6310\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461503616_522223347119839_5069771061401339952_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6311\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461520932_522223467119827_562611556551221979_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6312\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/10/461548255_522223483786492_8743584808770454636_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm 