(6357, 10, '2024-11-06 16:22:23', '2024-11-06 08:22:23', '菲律賓臺商總會青商會於9月15日舉辦中秋節「博中秋」慶祝活動，由該總會總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林登峰</span>及青商會會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">陳義</span>主持，此次活動吸引了眾多臺商會員及其家人參加，現場氣氛熱烈溫馨，共同歡度中秋佳節。\r\n\r\n<!--more--><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6356\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/460323135_513090771366430_2810278050836870519_n-250x121.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '菲總青商會舉辦中秋活動', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6355-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:22:23', '2024-11-06 08:22:23', '', 6355, 'https://astcc.asia/6355-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6358, 10, '2024-11-06 16:24:27', '2024-11-06 08:24:27', '菲律賓臺商總會青商會於8月11日下午在馬尼拉舉辦「2024年青商盃保齡球大賽」，由該會會長陳義及團隊共同策劃，其總會總會長林登峰、名譽總會長林在良及李欣芬、及多位會員及貴賓等人皆共襄盛舉。凝聚情感，活動圓滿完成。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6359\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/WM_cL1Dlca9g3d1THOgqPWwVN2glz2z1MrbVIUIxvec-250x138.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '菲總青商會舉辦保齡球賽', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e9%9d%92%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e4%bf%9d%e9%bd%a1%e7%90%83%e8%b3%bd', '', '', '2024-11-06 16:29:11', '2024-11-06 08:29:11', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6358', 0, 'post', '', 0),
