(6477, 10, '2024-11-11 10:47:43', '2024-11-11 02:47:43', '印度清奈台商會新辦事處、會所於9月14日成立，<!--more-->在印各地台商會代表齊聚一堂，除展現台商團結，更是將德里、班加羅爾、清奈，及大孟買地區串連起來的重要里程碑，對台商之間交流及布局印度將有很大幫助。\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/459959986_513093938032780_1290704810961623088_n.jpg?_nc_cat=106&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_eui2=AeEQvjP6PIXYf4jU1nHOVcmo65A3chYuPETrkDdyFi48RHBUGvM9oykR0pMMO2zOzEg&amp;_nc_ohc=P2mtwPPIqwkQ7kNvgEpWSPS&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AG-epoP-vF1Hy7KKCmMrc3z&amp;oh=00_AYCK1PRsP4zLYlJK6gpIGBPzik3jbQQXVbOjHH1SW0Uf4Q&amp;oe=67375BCF\" alt=\"May be an image of 14 people, hospital and text\" />\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/460396731_513093908032783_7715155591622853658_n.jpg?_nc_cat=108&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_eui2=AeH3Q5BrnoY8otiBLy6eZugBG43cTgjIuSwbjdxOCMi5LDmkn4tNLvDSiUA6CjGoyVw&amp;_nc_ohc=NCqoqn4HMysQ7kNvgEe2Hzs&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AVSa2hp7_ar7D4e2X8VeUSd&amp;oh=00_AYCGGKCVqeM1q16k8QGeQIWmST0E4e55ToELlECX-HTodQ&amp;oe=67375186\" alt=\"May be an image of 2 people, dais and text\" />', '印度清奈台商會成立辦事處與會所', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e5%8d%b0%e5%ba%a6%e6%b8%85%e5%a5%88%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e6%88%90%e7%ab%8b%e8%be%a6%e4%ba%8b%e8%99%95%e8%88%87%e6%9c%83%e6%89%80', '', '', '2024-11-11 10:47:43', '2024-11-11 02:47:43', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6477', 0, 'post', '', 0),
