(6485, 10, '2024-11-11 10:52:21', '2024-11-11 02:52:21', '2024/09/27(五) <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">菲律賓台商總會</span>與<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">國軍左營總醫院</span>簽訂醫療及健檢服務契約，<!--more-->簽約儀式由菲律賓台商總會總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林登峰</span>與國軍左營總醫院院長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">洪恭誠少將</span>代表簽署合約，列席人員計總會代表等10餘員，一同見證合約簽署，會中透過「國軍左營總醫院介紹」影片，並參觀高階電腦斷層影像中心、放射治療中心及高壓氧艙，由專人介紹各項專業設備，讓與會貴賓了解整體環境及相關醫療設備為臺商及眷屬提供更全面優質的醫療及健檢服務。\r\n\r\n<img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/461773188_523826716959502_1507322176089595754_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600&amp;_nc_cat=106&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=833d8c&amp;_nc_eui2=AeEr8vvedUzMq3srdp-zc4wTKcI7EGNzdEEpwjsQY3N0QaSMkxyIL5r6V7TMSdEjeE8&amp;_nc_ohc=6wkoGiUszgYQ7kNvgG18qnb&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=AmOU2Hx51EmkXze9imAttDf&amp;oh=00_AYBvEn7_PQGetnEINKx6aF_pbB9v5ecM01-RvLfmrmuYkg&amp;oe=67371AD0\" />', '菲總與國軍左營總醫院簽訂醫療及健檢服務契約', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%87%e5%9c%8b%e8%bb%8d%e5%b7%a6%e7%87%9f%e7%b8%bd%e9%86%ab%e9%99%a2%e7%b0%bd%e8%a8%82%e9%86%ab%e7%99%82%e5%8f%8a%e5%81%a5%e6%aa%a2%e6%9c%8d%e5%8b%99%e5%a5%91%e7%b4%84', '', '', '2024-11-11 10:52:21', '2024-11-11 02:52:21', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6485', 0, 'post', '', 0),
