\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\"><a class=\"x1i10hfl xjbqb8w x1ejq31n xd10rxx x1sy0etr x17r0tee x972fbf xcfux6l x1qhh985 xm0m39n x9f619 x1ypdohk xt0psk2 xe8uvvx xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x16tdsg8 x1hl2dhg xggy1nq x1a2a7pz x1sur9pj xkrqix3 x1fey0fg\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" href=\"http://nihon-taishokai.kilo.jp/activity/614.html?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTAAAR0ZKByEKgssJ_Q7sPq5yfjoMBQ7V4pA00-lCwIlIwBKe7HeRtNWYACxgTw_aem_VgAHfEohnSeJvjXGObvJqg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">http://nihon-taishokai.kilo.jp/activity/614.html</a></span></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/464105070_537705312238309_5594788537416590292_n.jpg?_nc_cat=100&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_eui2=AeFXW6T4GVxC2tgHbwimbJ-xXwn4V_QVeqxfCfhX9BV6rMWF1Bptoy76aeUmGH9cyhA&amp;_nc_ohc=Tp8LBO4n_CoQ7kNvgGjiJW3&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=ArHj_yggPxQfU_oo1kphNkM&amp;oh=00_AYBTi51VTZBiLFIXRdGFwMbsFlq1hS9Gg00pk0fW4Pm5JA&amp;oe=67375889\" alt=\"參加總統府雙十國慶典禮\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '日總十月回國訪問團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6500-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-11-11 11:00:25', '2024-11-11 03:00:25', '', 6500, 'https://astcc.asia/6500-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6502, 10, '2024-11-11 11:02:55', '2024-11-11 03:02:55', '<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">菲律賓台商總會在2024.10.26 (六)舉辦2024僑務委員會經貿專題巡迴講座。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">上午首先由該會<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林登峰</span>總會長代表與財團法人塑膠工業發展中心雙方簽署合作備忘錄（MOU)，接著發展中心總經理蕭耀貴，分享「永續、高值與數位轉型的創新趨勢」。下午前往Klio企業參訪，由董事長楊瑜玉親自接待。Klio專注於生產高品質食品保鮮盒，雙方就產品技術、環保及食品安全的要求進行深入交流。下午講座現場則由集仕多股份有限公司創辦人梁哲瑋主講：「AI主播來了！產業該怎麼應用」，以及林登峰總會長的「數位養殖案例分享」。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">全天的活動讓參與者收穫豐富，圓滿成功</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img src=\"https://scontent.fbkk21-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t39.30808-6/465734209_548535697821937_6538289744476076225_n.jpg?_nc_cat=101&amp;ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=127cfc&amp;_nc_eui2=AeFWOWZszagREwuKp2eY9H8gT_kfeHJjM0dP-R94cmMzR7mfGchj_7yaJiS7L-bEbrg&amp;_nc_ohc=v1SfHnBZ2AgQ7kNvgHRrcwI&amp;_nc_zt=23&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.fbkk21-1.fna&amp;_nc_gid=Ax_2RpPDL7U88KyvmjXL4kc&amp;oh=00_AYDH4xLTerXLylLTqjCHkjno5Qg1xqJnxih_yoJ4-_fIgQ&amp;oe=67372C07\" alt=\"May be an image of 13 people and text\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '菲總舉辦2024年僑委會經貿講座', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%89%e8%be%a62024%e5%b9%b4%e5%83%91%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e7%b6%93%e8%b2%bf%e8%ac%9b%e5%ba%a7', '', '', '2024-11-11 11:03:11', '2024-11-11 03:03:11', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6502', 0, 'post', '', 0),
