(6541, 10, '2024-12-19 14:17:38', '2024-12-19 06:17:38', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本屆亞總特別於會議開始前，11月29日在The Mines Resort &amp; Golf Club舉辦會前高爾夫球賽，</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">讓來自亞洲及世界各國的高球愛好者有更多的機會交流，並體驗馬來西亞球場，盡情揮杆。此活動吸引共72人熱情參與，賽前及賽後皆備有餐宴聯誼，以球會友，聯絡彼此感情。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6540\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/469807615_570871785588328_5601041228331049815_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總32-2《會前高爾夫球賽》', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6539-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-12-19 14:17:38', '2024-12-19 06:17:38', '', 6539, 'https://astcc.asia/6539-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6542, 10, '2024-12-19 14:19:49', '2024-12-19 06:19:49', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">馬來西亞台商總會於11月29日晚間在金龍船餐廳設宴歡迎亞總理監事及貴賓們蒞臨馬來西亞吉隆坡，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">由亞總秘書長暨馬總副總會長康耀忠致歡迎詞，並由海基會羅文嘉副董事長代表貴賓致詞。所有與會者在美妙的現場live band演唱下，感受到當地臺商的熱情，為接下來三天亞總32-2的相關系列會議及活動揭開序幕。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6543\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/469687725_570913205584186_5076193203920886416_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6544\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/469797445_570916998917140_8905980285380348010_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6545\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/469868464_570913492250824_6661149353652012326_n-250x192.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;', '亞總32-2《馬來西亞台商總會 會前晚宴》', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd32-2%e3%80%8a%e9%a6%ac%e4%be%86%e8%a5%bf%e4%ba%9e%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83-%e6%9c%83%e5%89%8d%e6%99%9a%e5%ae%b4%e3%80%8b', '', '', '2024-12-19 14:19:49', '2024-12-19 06:19:49', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6542', 0, 'post', '', 0),
