(6576, 10, '2024-12-19 14:38:00', '2024-12-19 06:38:00', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">越南台灣商會聯合總會於12月15日下午在越南頭頓召開第25屆第4次理監事聯席會議，會後並舉辦總會長及監事長交接典禮。<!--more--></div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本會總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民及</span>監事長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">吳國本</span>受邀參加。越南臺商會本地理監事及海外貴賓雲集，晚會熱鬧，圓滿成功。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">恭喜越總</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第25屆總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">蔡文瑞</span> 功成身退</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第26屆總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">袁濟凡</span> 眾望所歸</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第25、26屆監事長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">黃雍正</span> 連任成功</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6575\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/470238395_575449928463847_8121476602516783441_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6574\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/470664458_575449968463843_7649777699572721122_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '越總第25屆第4次理監事聯席會議、總會長及監事長交接典禮', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6573-revision-v1', '', '', '2024-12-19 14:38:00', '2024-12-19 06:38:00', '', 6573, 'https://astcc.asia/6573-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
