(6625, 10, '2025-03-12 14:15:34', '2025-03-12 06:15:34', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">香港台灣工商協會於1月6日舉辦「香港台灣工商協會三十二週年慶暨第十六屆董事就職典禮」，近400位來自海外及香港友會的嘉賓、本會會員和朋友的支持，晚會筵開三十席共襄盛舉。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6626\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473357908_595052093170297_1798921936519665722_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6627\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473598597_595052099836963_1833654111181333701_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '香港台灣工商協會三十二週年慶暨第十六屆董事就職典禮', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%a6%99%e6%b8%af%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%b7%a5%e5%95%86%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83%e4%b8%89%e5%8d%81%e4%ba%8c%e9%80%b1%e5%b9%b4%e6%85%b6%e6%9a%a8%e7%ac%ac%e5%8d%81%e5%85%ad%e5%b1%86%e8%91%a3%e4%ba%8b%e5%b0%b1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:15:34', '2025-03-12 06:15:34', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6625', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(6626, 10, '2025-03-12 14:15:14', '2025-03-12 06:15:14', '', '473357908_595052093170297_1798921936519665722_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '473357908_595052093170297_1798921936519665722_n', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:15:14', '2025-03-12 06:15:14', '', 6625, 'https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473357908_595052093170297_1798921936519665722_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6627, 10, '2025-03-12 14:15:14', '2025-03-12 06:15:14', '', '473598597_595052099836963_1833654111181333701_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '473598597_595052099836963_1833654111181333701_n', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:15:14', '2025-03-12 06:15:14', '', 6625, 'https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473598597_595052099836963_1833654111181333701_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6628, 10, '2025-03-12 14:15:34', '2025-03-12 06:15:34', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">香港台灣工商協會於1月6日舉辦「香港台灣工商協會三十二週年慶暨第十六屆董事就職典禮」，近400位來自海外及香港友會的嘉賓、本會會員和朋友的支持，晚會筵開三十席共襄盛舉。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6626\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473357908_595052093170297_1798921936519665722_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6627\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/473598597_595052099836963_1833654111181333701_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '香港台灣工商協會三十二週年慶暨第十六屆董事就職典禮', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6625-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:15:34', '2025-03-12 06:15:34', '', 6625, 'https://astcc.asia/6625-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6629, 10, '2025-03-12 14:18:03', '2025-03-12 06:18:03', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總去年九月曾組「帛琉產業考察團」，並得到正面肯定。此次應 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">#帛琉總統惠恕仁</span>(Surangel S. Whipps, Jr.)之邀，本會總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span> 再度組團隨同外交部部長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林佳龍</span> 以總統特使身分的慶賀團，15日前往出席帛琉正副總統就職典禮，展開四天三夜的旅程。除特使團包含衛福部、外交部、體育署及其他單位人員，另有亞總台商及台灣企業代表45人，藉由民間產業交流與投資，促進台灣與帛琉之間的雙邊經貿合作，鞏固邦誼。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">首日的歡迎晚宴由駐帛琉使館 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">黎倩儀</span> 大使主持，帛琉當地政府官員亦出席與慶賀團交流。此次的產業團陣容龐大且具有前瞻性，展示了台灣產業的實力，並積極推動兩國在 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">國家發展計劃</span>、<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">永續旅遊</span>、<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">交通</span>及 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">智慧醫療等方面的合作</span>，實現互助互利。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6630\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474154701_597944372881069_1086248312682750432_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6631\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474201947_597944379547735_1254965257156110896_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總帛琉正副總統就職典禮慶賀團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e6%ad%a3%e5%89%af%e7%b8%bd%e7%b5%b1%e5%b0%b1%e8%81%b7%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae%e6%85%b6%e8%b3%80%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:18:25', '2025-03-12 06:18:25', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6629', 0, 'post', '', 0),
