(6639, 10, '2025-03-12 14:21:40', '2025-03-12 06:21:40', '', '474454239_599685142706992_1282784995236362030_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '474454239_599685142706992_1282784995236362030_n', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:21:40', '2025-03-12 06:21:40', '', 6637, 'https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474454239_599685142706992_1282784995236362030_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6640, 10, '2025-03-12 14:21:46', '2025-03-12 06:21:46', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第三日</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">17日上午惠恕仁總統親自向產業團團員進行 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">Malakal港區</span> 開發簡報及<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">保利馬氫氣船</span> 之說明。結束後，應惠總統之邀前往<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">洛克群島</span> 參訪海洋自然保育，體驗乘風破浪及南島海洋文化的熱情。午餐時間，惠總統偕林佳龍部長於無人島上與所有團員逐一拍照留念，充分展現友好情誼及對我團之高度重視。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">當晚全團出席<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">特使晚宴</span> ，惠總統及新任國會眾議長Gibson Kanai、國會議員、傳統領袖及全團共150人與宴，場面盛大。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6638\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474278622_599685082706998_7096663633238010423_n-250x141.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6639\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474454239_599685142706992_1282784995236362030_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表參訪海洋保育及特使晚宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6637-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:21:46', '2025-03-12 06:21:46', '', 6637, 'https://astcc.asia/6637-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6641, 10, '2025-03-12 14:23:32', '2025-03-12 06:23:32', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">18日上午，外交部帛琉總統就職典禮慶賀團赴艾來州傳統男人會館進行文化參訪，深入體驗當地傳統舞蹈並了解戰船文化。中午，帛琉台商會會長李志偉設宴招待團員，多位當地台商出席與團員交流；本會總會長林凱民在致辭後，特別向林佳龍部長及駐帛黎倩儀大使贈送紀念品，以感謝他們對此次行程的規劃與協助。餐後，團員們實地考察了三家由台商投資經營的飯店：Papago Resort、帛琉大飯店PALASIA HOTEL PALAU及月伴灣飯店Palau Landmark Marina，了解當地旅遊飯店產業，探索投資商機。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">最後在享用點心及稍作休息後前往機場返台，帛琉國務部部長 Gustav Aitaro及帛琉駐台大使歐儒侃（David Adams Orrukem）親自前來送機，展現對於此團的重視與友好。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">此行圓滿完成，為我國「榮邦計畫」在帛琉邁出堅實步伐，並為協助打造帛琉成為「智慧永續島嶼」奠定了良好基礎。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6642\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474204447_599943402681166_477448214976245757_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6643\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474516759_599943036014536_6697599893779615266_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6644\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474564372_599942789347894_128834541269618668_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表團進行帛琉文化參訪及考察飯店旅遊業', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e5%9c%98%e9%80%b2%e8%a1%8c%e5%b8%9b%e7%90%89%e6%96%87%e5%8c%96%e5%8f%83%e8%a8%aa%e5%8f%8a%e8%80%83%e5%af%9f%e9%a3%af%e5%ba%97%e6%97%85%e9%81%8a%e6%a5%ad%e3%80%91', '', '', '2025-03-12 16:10:31', '2025-03-12 08:10:31', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6641', 0, 'post', '', 0),
