(6664, 10, '2025-03-12 14:32:56', '2025-03-12 06:32:56', '', '475691811_605439538798219_9163779434700318596_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '475691811_605439538798219_9163779434700318596_n', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:32:56', '2025-03-12 06:32:56', '', 6662, 'https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/475691811_605439538798219_9163779434700318596_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6665, 10, '2025-03-12 14:33:10', '2025-03-12 06:33:10', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">印度台商總會、駐印度代表處近期舉辦晚宴，讓在異鄉打拚的遊子，也能感受到家鄉過節的溫馨氣氛。豐盛的餐點，祝福彼此在來年能更加豐收。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6663\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/475634366_605439545464885_4796022379707866800_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6664\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/475691811_605439538798219_9163779434700318596_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '印度台商總會、駐印度代表處舉辦晚宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6662-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:33:10', '2025-03-12 06:33:10', '', 6662, 'https://astcc.asia/6662-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6666, 10, '2025-03-12 14:34:17', '2025-03-12 06:34:17', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">18日上午，外交部帛琉總統就職典禮慶賀團赴艾來州傳統男人會館進行文化參訪，深入體驗當地傳統舞蹈並了解戰船文化。中午，帛琉台商會會長李志偉設宴招待團員，多位當地台商出席與團員交流；本會總會長林凱民在致辭後，特別向林佳龍部長及駐帛黎倩儀大使贈送紀念品，以感謝他們對此次行程的規劃與協助。餐後，團員們實地考察了三家由台商投資經營的飯店：Papago Resort、帛琉大飯店PALASIA HOTEL PALAU及月伴灣飯店Palau Landmark Marina，了解當地旅遊飯店產業，探索投資商機。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">最後在享用點心及稍作休息後前往機場返台，帛琉國務部部長 Gustav Aitaro及帛琉駐台大使歐儒侃（David Adams Orrukem）親自前來送機，展現對於此團的重視與友好。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">此行圓滿完成，為我國「榮邦計畫」在帛琉邁出堅實步伐，並為協助打造帛琉成為「智慧永續島嶼」奠定了良好基礎。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6642\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474204447_599943402681166_477448214976245757_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6643\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474516759_599943036014536_6697599893779615266_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6644\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/474564372_599942789347894_128834541269618668_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總代表團進行帛琉文化參訪及考察飯店旅遊業', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6641-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:34:17', '2025-03-12 06:34:17', '', 6641, 'https://astcc.asia/6641-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6668, 10, '2025-03-12 14:37:04', '2025-03-12 06:37:04', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">2025年臺。美。亞洲</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新供應鏈商機交流論壇</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲(馬來西亞)之夜暨乙巳年新春晚宴</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">此活動由世總、亞總及北美洲總合辦，由今週刊承辦，將於2月8日在台北君悅酒店舉辦，各方籌備負責人員於2月5日上午實際探勘場地及討論會議。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6669\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476163768_610792701596236_5236155143701548886_n-250x117.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6670\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476222603_610916638250509_7054351199936725007_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '2025年臺。美。亞洲 新供應鏈商機交流論壇探勘場地及討論', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '2025%e5%b9%b4%e8%87%ba%e3%80%82%e7%be%8e%e3%80%82%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2-%e6%96%b0%e4%be%9b%e6%87%89%e9%8f%88%e5%95%86%e6%a9%9f%e4%ba%a4%e6%b5%81%e8%ab%96%e5%a3%87%e6%8e%a2%e5%8b%98%e5%a0%b4%e5%9c%b0', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:37:04', '2025-03-12 06:37:04', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6668', 0, 'post', '', 0),
