(6671, 10, '2025-03-12 14:37:04', '2025-03-12 06:37:04', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">2025年臺。美。亞洲</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新供應鏈商機交流論壇</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲(馬來西亞)之夜暨乙巳年新春晚宴</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">此活動由世總、亞總及北美洲總合辦，由今週刊承辦，將於2月8日在台北君悅酒店舉辦，各方籌備負責人員於2月5日上午實際探勘場地及討論會議。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6669\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476163768_610792701596236_5236155143701548886_n-250x117.jpg\" alt=\"\" /><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6670\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476222603_610916638250509_7054351199936725007_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '2025年臺。美。亞洲 新供應鏈商機交流論壇探勘場地及討論', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6668-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:37:04', '2025-03-12 06:37:04', '', 6668, 'https://astcc.asia/6668-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6672, 10, '2025-03-12 14:39:29', '2025-03-12 06:39:29', '海基會於2月3日在美福大飯店舉辦「2025大陸台商春節活動」，本會總會長林凱民受邀參加，盼亞洲台商共同促進全球的佈局，展現台灣經濟實力。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6673\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/475786917_610170931658413_6076865248566672421_n-250x333.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6674\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476102678_610170934991746_33812412429940242_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6675\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/476164051_610170974991742_3647376811339137270_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '本會總會長林凱民受邀參加「2025大陸台商春節活動」', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%9c%ac%e6%9c%83%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e9%95%b7%e6%9e%97%e5%87%b1%e6%b0%91%e5%8f%97%e9%82%80%e5%8f%83%e5%8a%a0%e3%80%8c2025%e5%a4%a7%e9%99%b8%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e6%98%a5%e7%af%80%e6%b4%bb%e5%8b%95', '', '', '2025-03-12 14:39:29', '2025-03-12 06:39:29', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6672', 0, 'post', '', 0),
