(6723, 10, '2025-03-12 15:00:47', '2025-03-12 07:00:47', '印尼台灣工商聯誼會聯合總會青商會於2月22日在雅加達PIK中餐廳舉辦春節晚宴暨會員歌唱比賽，該青商會會長賴仲威帶領小朋友表演舞蹈，現場笑聲不斷、喜氣洋洋。這場充滿美食、音樂與歡樂的夜晚，為新的一年揭開美好序幕，也讓每位來賓都帶著滿滿的幸福回憶而歸。<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6721\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480698394_623177290357777_7822729234473353933_n-250x210.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6722\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481302501_623177293691110_4742365982557888943_n-250x210.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '印青舉辦春節晚宴暨會員歌唱比賽', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6720-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 15:00:47', '2025-03-12 07:00:47', '', 6720, 'https://astcc.asia/6720-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6724, 10, '2025-03-12 15:01:38', '2025-03-12 07:01:38', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">泰國臺灣商會聯合總會青商會於2月17日在泰國安美德集團總部Amata Corporation Company Limited舉辦晚宴，該集團董事長邱威功（Mr. Vikrom Kromadit）與年輕人們分享成功經營之道，正向共贏發展。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6725\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480753349_623199407022232_629735003557618226_n-250x131.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6726\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481272313_623199423688897_2825114125036763506_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '泰青舉辦AMATA座談會及餐敘', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%b3%b0%e9%9d%92%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6amata%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83%e5%8f%8a%e9%a4%90%e6%95%98', '', '', '2025-03-12 15:01:38', '2025-03-12 07:01:38', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6724', 0, 'post', '', 0),
