(6742, 10, '2025-03-12 15:06:20', '2025-03-12 07:06:20', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">日本台灣商會聯合總會由總會長東鄉清龍率領於1月8日至10日舉辦回國訪問團，拜訪了台灣各地及其他相關單位。<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6741\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481676772_630564169619089_4767187159018238617_n-250x48.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>', '日總舉辦回國訪問團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6740-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-03-12 15:06:20', '2025-03-12 07:06:20', '', 6740, 'https://astcc.asia/6740-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6743, 10, '2025-03-12 16:06:33', '2025-03-12 08:06:33', '<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">，開票結束後並隨即舉辦交接典禮。本會總會長林凱民及僑務委員會委員長徐佳青應邀出席並參加交接儀式。現場海內外貴賓雲集，氣氛熱鬧。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">感謝<span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x168nmei x13lgxp2 x5pf9jr xo71vjh\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t80/1/16/1f64f.png\" alt=\"🙏\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>日本台灣商會聯合總會第12屆</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">總會長 東鄉清龍</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">監事長 藤田礼子</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">無私奉獻 功成身退</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">恭喜<span class=\"html-span xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xgzva0m xhhsvwb xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x168nmei x13lgxp2 x5pf9jr xo71vjh\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb4/1/16/1f38a.png\" alt=\"🎊\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>日本台灣商會聯合總會第13屆</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">總會長 洪益芬</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">監事長 黃暉強</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">任重道遠 眾望所歸</div>\r\n</div>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6744\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/482042330_633186846023488_9119196344090335934_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6745\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/482262551_633186789356827_577485268857753855_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6746\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/482355835_633186849356821_6091168046945411616_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6747\" src=\"h