(6767, 10, '2025-04-21 10:43:13', '2025-04-21 02:43:13', '本會總會長林凱民於3月6日參訪位於苗栗縣竹南鎮的群聯電子並與該公司董事長潘健成面談，<!--more-->\r\n\r\n邀請在今年7月亞總年會的論壇分享最新的AI技術及未來走勢。此次交流不僅為年會內容規劃提供了寶貴的參考，也進一步促進了學界與產業界在前沿技術領域的合作與對話。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6766\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488450875_652410720767767_3450023075247121457_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞總拜訪群聯電子董事長潘健成', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6765-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:43:13', '2025-04-21 02:43:13', '', 6765, 'https://astcc.asia/6765-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6768, 10, '2025-04-21 10:46:10', '2025-04-21 02:46:10', '<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">新加坡台北工商協會</span>於3月8日舉辦「國際婦女節特別講座International Women’s Day Special Talk」，<!--more-->以女性健康：從青春期到老年的生育與保健之道為主題，由該會會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">呂玉靜</span> 主持，探討女性在不同生命階段的健康需求與挑戰。此講座促進女性之間的交流與學習，提升整體健康意識。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6769\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489640550_656542400354599_5782544680647853923_n-250x118.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '新加坡台北工商協會舉辦「國際婦女節特別講座International Women’s Day Special Talk」', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%96%b0%e5%8a%a0%e5%9d%a1%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e5%b7%a5%e5%95%86%e5%8d%94%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e3%80%8c%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e5%a9%a6%e5%a5%b3%e7%af%80%e7%89%b9%e5%88%a5%e8%ac%9b%e5%ba%a7internation', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:46:19', '2025-04-21 02:46:19', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6768', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(6769, 10, '2025-04-21 10:45:48', '2025-04-21 02:45:48', '', '489640550_656542400354599_5782544680647853923_n', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', '489640550_656542400354599_5782544680647853923_n', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:45:48', '2025-04-21 02:45:48', '', 6768, 'https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489640550_656542400354599_5782544680647853923_n.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(6770, 10, '2025-04-21 10:46:10', '2025-04-21 02:46:10', '<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">新加坡台北工商協會</span>於3月8日舉辦「國際婦女節特別講座International Women’s Day Special Talk」，<!--more-->以女性健康：從青春期到老年的生育與保健之道為主題，由該會會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">呂玉靜</span> 主持，探討女性在不同生命階段的健康需求與挑戰。此講座促進女性之間的交流與學習，提升整體健康意識。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6769\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489640550_656542400354599_5782544680647853923_n-250x118.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '新加坡台北工商協會舉辦「國際婦女節特別講座International Women’s Day Special Talk」', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6768-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:46:10', '2025-04-21 02:46:10', '', 6768, 'https://astcc.asia/6768-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
