(6782, 10, '2025-04-21 10:56:37', '2025-04-21 02:56:37', '日本台灣商會聯合總會青商會於3月9日舉辦交接典禮，\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n由該會滿任會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林德修</span>交接至新任會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林怡君</span> ，本會青商會代理會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">李嘉鴻</span> 及僑委會委員長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">徐佳青</span> 見證監交儀式。典禮圓滿成功，盼年輕新世代迎向更美好未來。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6783\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/490299725_657337433608429_1425283828818484249_n-250x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '日青舉辦交接典禮', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%97%a5%e9%9d%92%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e4%ba%a4%e6%8e%a5%e5%85%b8%e7%a6%ae', '', '', '2025-04-21 10:56:37', '2025-04-21 02:56:37', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6782', 0, 'post', '', 0),
