(6811, 10, '2025-04-21 11:16:17', '2025-04-21 03:16:17', '韓國台灣商會青商會於3月22日召開第一次理監事會議，共同討論今年度準備申請亞洲台商會青商會觀察會員國的準備事宜與未來韓國青商會的發展方向。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6809\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486287099_644722658203240_7460487769715069957_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6810\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/486467869_644722674869905_773880295899799783_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '韓國台灣商會青商會召開理監事會議', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6808-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:16:17', '2025-04-21 03:16:17', '', 6808, 'https://astcc.asia/6808-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6812, 10, '2025-04-21 11:18:45', '2025-04-21 03:18:45', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會第32屆回國訪問團於3月31日至4月2日組團拜會政府各機關部門。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n此次由總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span>、監事長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">吳國本</span>偕同輔導總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">許玉林</span>及來自20個會員國及觀察會員國的副總會長/代表及工作團隊共同組團。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6813\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489323898_654639833878189_8623869686752111449_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6814\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488767450_652597484082424_3561346432027368066_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6815\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489427389_654176867257819_266382998077625717_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6816\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489470940_654869387188567_5395543704075850485_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會第32屆回國訪問團', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2%e5%8f%b0%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e7%ac%ac32%e5%b1%86%e5%9b%9e%e5%9c%8b%e8%a8%aa%e5%95%8f%e5%9c%98', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:18:57', '2025-04-21 03:18:57', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6812', 0, 'post', '', 0),
