(6817, 10, '2025-04-21 11:18:45', '2025-04-21 03:18:45', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會第32屆回國訪問團於3月31日至4月2日組團拜會政府各機關部門。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n此次由總會長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">林凱民</span>、監事長<span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">吳國本</span>偕同輔導總會長 <span class=\"html-span xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r xexx8yu x4uap5 x18d9i69 xkhd6sd x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs\">許玉林</span>及來自20個會員國及觀察會員國的副總會長/代表及工作團隊共同組團。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6813\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489323898_654639833878189_8623869686752111449_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6814\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/488767450_652597484082424_3561346432027368066_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6815\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489427389_654176867257819_266382998077625717_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6816\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489470940_654869387188567_5395543704075850485_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會第32屆回國訪問團', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6812-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:18:45', '2025-04-21 03:18:45', '', 6812, 'https://astcc.asia/6812-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6818, 10, '2025-04-21 11:20:18', '2025-04-21 03:20:18', '菲律賓臺商總會青商會於4月6日由會長陳義及團隊籌劃舉辦企業參訪與釣蝦體驗活動。\r\n\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n該總會總會長林登峰亦應邀出席鼓勵青商。此次活動旨在帶領旅菲青年商界朋友實地參觀由臺灣企業家經營的釣蝦場，並藉由業主的經驗分享，深入了解在菲律賓投資休閒產業的經營與管理方式，進一步提升青年對企業運作的認識，並鼓勵更多旅菲青年加入青商會。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6819\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489784622_656553673686805_7501286842022276104_n-250x181.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6820\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/489829698_656553643686808_2402507933825992637_n-250x148.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;', '菲青舉辦企業參訪及釣蝦體驗活動', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e9%9d%92%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e4%bc%81%e6%a5%ad%e5%8f%83%e8%a8%aa%e5%8f%8a%e9%87%a3%e8%9d%a6%e9%ab%94%e9%a9%97%e6%b4%bb%e5%8b%95', '', '', '2025-04-21 11:20:18', '2025-04-21 03:20:18', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6818', 0, 'post', '', 0),
