(6838, 10, '2025-07-31 13:51:25', '2025-07-31 05:51:25', '<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">菲律賓臺商總會由該會總會長林登峰及代表於4月12日接待來自國內臺中榮民總醫院醫療訪問團隊，雙方舉行「臺中榮總國際醫療遠距服務中心」揭牌儀式，將為開啟守護旅菲臺商健康的起點。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6839\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/491535293_661195466555959_2673145958512939700_n-250x133.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6840\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/491287020_661195443222628_1233036331083148614_n-250x142.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '菲總攜手臺中榮總 國際醫療遠距服務中心揭牌', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e6%94%9c%e6%89%8b%e8%87%ba%e4%b8%ad%e6%a6%ae%e7%b8%bd-%e5%9c%8b%e9%9a%9b%e9%86%ab%e7%99%82%e9%81%a0%e8%b7%9d%e6%9c%8d%e5%8b%99%e4%b8%ad%e5%bf%83%e6%8f%ad%e7%89%8c', '', '', '2025-07-31 13:51:25', '2025-07-31 05:51:25', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6838', 0, 'post', '', 0),
