(6852, 10, '2025-07-31 14:02:45', '2025-07-31 06:02:45', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">馬來西亞台灣商會聯合總會於4月30日召開第17屆理監事第7次會議，由該會兼亞總總會長林凱民主持。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">分會吉隆坡台灣商會會長蔡欣恬及幹部用心籌備，轄下七個分會會長及全國理事踴躍出席，並積極討論各項關於推動本會業務發展及謀求會員利益的議題。會前會後聯誼晚宴亦圓滿結束。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6853\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/494517637_673381285337377_1538085495366336817_n-250x182.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6854\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/494724127_673381278670711_5121622558622773855_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '馬總召開第17屆理監事第7次會議', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e9%a6%ac%e7%b8%bd%e5%8f%ac%e9%96%8b%e7%ac%ac17%e5%b1%86%e7%90%86%e7%9b%a3%e4%ba%8b%e7%ac%ac7%e6%ac%a1%e6%9c%83%e8%ad%b0', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:03:24', '2025-07-31 06:03:24', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6852', 0, 'post', '', 0),
