(6864, 10, '2025-07-31 14:13:41', '2025-07-31 06:13:41', '新加坡台北工商協會於5月10日舉辦公開導讀，<!--more-->由台灣知名作家劉克襄親臨導讀分享著作《小站也有遠方》。台灣知名作家劉克襄以鐵道為藍圖，帶領讀者走出旅行的新價值。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6863\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/497509836_680438974631608_5183259311617766231_n-250x94.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '新加坡台北工商協會舉辦公開導讀', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6862-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:13:41', '2025-07-31 06:13:41', '', 6862, 'https://astcc.asia/6862-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6865, 10, '2025-07-31 14:15:24', '2025-07-31 06:15:24', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">為聲援臺灣參與第78屆世界衛生大會（WHA），菲律賓台商總會與菲律賓台商總會青商會聯合發起5月11日「逗陣來晨跑：Taiwan for WHA」活動。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->駐菲代表處、台商與僑界人士近100人以健走與慢跑方式，在超過2萬人活動的公眾場合中，向菲國民眾傳達臺灣希望參與WHA的訴求。\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6866\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/496122479_680656234609882_3034098613004199742_n-250x124.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6867\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/496006984_680656237943215_210430938783900116_n-250x125.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '菲總與菲青聯合發起「逗陣來晨跑：Taiwan for WHA」活動', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e8%8f%b2%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%87%e8%8f%b2%e9%9d%92%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%99%bc%e8%b5%b7%e3%80%8c%e9%80%97%e9%99%a3%e4%be%86%e6%99%a8%e8%b7%91%ef%bc%9ataiwan-for-wha%e3%80%8d%e6%b4%bb%e5%8b%95', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:15:24', '2025-07-31 06:15:24', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6865', 0, 'post', '', 0),
