(6872, 10, '2025-07-31 14:18:49', '2025-07-31 06:18:49', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">緬甸臺商總會日前在該會總會長楊友全及團隊的籌備下舉行歡慶母親節及端午活動，</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n幹部、會員、貴賓及緬甸友人逾160人共襄盛舉。在地震後的艱難時刻，臺商們發揮彼此關懷扶助力量，藉此活動凝聚力量，向緬甸人民展現臺灣人愛心，希望臺商棉薄之力能為緬甸社會帶來正能量。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6870\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/498176825_683179821024190_2664875516443127916_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6871\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/497899091_683179817690857_7699826730030522653_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>', '緬甸臺商總會舉行歡慶母親節及端午活動', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6869-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:18:49', '2025-07-31 06:18:49', '', 6869, 'https://astcc.asia/6869-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6873, 10, '2025-07-31 14:20:28', '2025-07-31 06:20:28', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">日本關西台商會青商會於5月10日在京都，舉辦「2025第二回台商劍道鍊成大會」。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">在明治32年（1899年）落成、歷史悠久的劍道殿堂中，來自日本各地的台僑夥伴齊聚一堂。透過劍道競技及精神，深度交流；重新認識自己，也重新連結彼此。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6874\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499975064_684816277527211_3935252996328967908_n-250x147.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6875\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499568953_684816304193875_4506003695379381111_n-250x148.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"></div>\r\n</div>', '日本關西台商會青商會舉辦「2025第二回台商劍道鍊成大會」', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac%e9%97%9c%e8%a5%bf%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e9%9d%92%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%88%89%e8%be%a6%e3%80%8c2025%e7%ac%ac%e4%ba%8c%e5%9b%9e%e5%8f%b0%e5%95%86%e5%8a%8d%e9%81%93%e9%8d%8a', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:20:28', '2025-07-31 06:20:28', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6873', 0, 'post', '', 0),
