(6903, 10, '2025-07-31 14:36:36', '2025-07-31 06:36:36', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">賴清德總統於5月20日晚間偕同蕭美琴副總統，在總統府以國宴宴請帛琉共和國總統惠恕仁（Surangel S. Whipps, Jr.）伉儷及訪團貴賓，盼持續促進兩國觀光交流及體育合作。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">本會總會長林凱民曾兩度率團友好拜訪帛琉，亦受邀出席此盛會，攜手推動兩國在經貿與觀光方面的合作。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6900\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/499989675_687618707246968_8949434757190002251_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6901\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500046153_687618703913635_8379960438604264720_n-250x166.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6902\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500225257_687618757246963_1936682617079276572_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '林凱民總會長受邀參加國宴', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '6899-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:36:36', '2025-07-31 06:36:36', '', 6899, 'https://astcc.asia/6899-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(6904, 10, '2025-07-31 14:39:02', '2025-07-31 06:39:02', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">駐泰國代表處與泰國臺灣商會聯合總會共同於5月23日(五)下午舉行「因應美國關稅政策臺商座談會」</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n\r\n邀請泰國政府官員「投資促進委員會(BOI)」副秘書長、「工業園區管理局(IEAT) 」助理局長共同出席，提供泰國官方最新政策資訊，共計逾百臺商企業經營者共襄盛舉。當地銀行金融代表分享關稅帶來的衝擊，並學習到匯率、債市、股票、基金等全方位的專業見解。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-6905\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/500196419_689865290355643_4787616162631046966_n-250x143.jpg\" alt=\"\" />\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\"></div>', '泰總與駐泰代表處「因應美國關稅政策臺商座談會」', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e6%b3%b0%e7%b8%bd%e8%88%87%e9%a7%90%e6%b3%b0%e4%bb%a3%e8%a1%a8%e8%99%95%e3%80%8c%e5%9b%a0%e6%87%89%e7%be%8e%e5%9c%8b%e9%97%9c%e7%a8%85%e6%94%bf%e7%ad%96%e8%87%ba%e5%95%86%e5%ba%a7%e8%ab%87%e6%9c%83', '', '', '2025-07-31 14:39:02', '2025-07-31 06:39:02', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=6904', 0, 'post', '', 0),
