(7010, 10, '2025-07-31 15:37:45', '2025-07-31 07:37:45', '亞洲台灣商會聯合總會與台北市政府產業發展局合辦「2025 亞洲嘉年華會」活動，<!--more-->於7月13日在台北101水舞廣場盛大登場。活動集結亞洲各地多國台商會員，在現場設置攤位展售其於海外經營的商品與服務，並搭配系列文化演出、公益捐贈與國際交流，全方位展現台灣企業在亞洲市場的深厚實力與跨境合作潛力。\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7008\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/519683481_732078102801028_5891231744201942723_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7009\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/518990828_732078256134346_5467118250930968113_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" />', '亞洲嘉年華會 「亞洲同行 攜手無界」', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7007-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:37:45', '2025-07-31 07:37:45', '', 7007, 'https://astcc.asia/7007-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(7011, 10, '2025-07-31 15:40:13', '2025-07-31 07:40:13', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總32-3【會前基隆港一日遊】</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">感謝基隆市政府及海巡署的鼎力支持與協助，亞總第32屆於7月14日舉辦「基隆港會前一日遊」，讓來自各國的理監事成員深入體驗基隆的山海魅力與文化底蘊。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t5b/2/16/1f30a.png\" alt=\"🌊\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第一站｜乘船繞行基隆嶼</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">搭船巡航基隆嶼，近距離觀賞海蝕洞、火成岩等壯觀的地質奇觀，感受自然的鬼斧神工。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t37/2/16/1f37d.png\" alt=\"🍽\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第二站｜基隆市政府設宴午宴</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">市長謝國樑親臨設宴款待亞總貴賓，現場與各國會員熱絡交流，展現基隆的熱情與國際友好精神。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t7d/2/16/1f4f8.png\" alt=\"📸\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第三站｜阿根納造船廠遺構 × 正濱漁港彩色屋</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">漫步於見證工業歷史的阿根納遺構，並打卡充滿藝術氣息的正濱彩色屋，感受基隆的文創魅力。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcf/2/16/1faa8.png\" alt=\"🪨\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第四站｜和平島地質公園探奇</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">走訪2300萬年前海底火山活動遺留的奇岩怪石，探索台灣東北角珍貴的地質資產。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t8a/2/16/1f377.png\" alt=\"🍷\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span> 第五站｜天顯宮晚宴</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">第32屆監事長吳國本於天顯宮設宴，款待來自亞總成員，美食佳餚，為一日遊畫下溫馨完美句點。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7012\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520223307_732453409430164_424546354081074058_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7013\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/518340416_732453822763456_9169120379322529196_n-250x188.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7014\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520170263_732453459430159_734318681730277369_n-250x187.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>', '亞總32-3【會前基隆港一日遊】', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd32-3%e3%80%90%e6%9c%83%e5%89%8d%e5%9f%ba%e9%9a%86%e6%b8%af%e4%b8%80%e6%97%a5%e9%81%8a%e3%80%91', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:42:45', '2025-07-31 07:42:45', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=7011', 0, 'post', '', 0),
