(7031, 10, '2025-07-31 15:47:42', '2025-07-31 07:47:42', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">【 2025 全球台商經濟論壇】</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞洲台灣商會總會攜手今周刊於7月16日舉辦《2025全球台商經濟論壇》，現場有台灣優勢產業暨品牌展，展現台灣產業實力與經濟活力，更有重磅講者現場解析全球關稅議題。</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb4/2/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>美國關稅政策對亞太地區的直接衝擊</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb4/2/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>產業如何調整策略迎接貿易新格局</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tb4/2/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>國際企業如何重建亞太的經貿關係</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td3/2/16/1f518.png\" alt=\"🔘\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>透析全球經濟關鍵字「關稅」與「匯率」｜今周刊 謝金河 董事長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td3/2/16/1f518.png\" alt=\"🔘\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>川普2.0—台灣企業的挑戰｜</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">外貿協會 黃志芳 董事長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td3/2/16/1f518.png\" alt=\"🔘\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>全球台商贏戰AI數位新賽道｜</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">iKala共同創辦人暨執行長 程世嘉</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td3/2/16/1f518.png\" alt=\"🔘\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>從對等關稅到產業韌性─臺北市的經濟優勢與布局｜</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">臺北市政府產業發展局 陳俊安 局長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><span class=\"html-span xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1hl2dhg x16tdsg8 x1vvkbs x3nfvp2 x1j61x8r x1fcty0u xdj266r xat24cr xm2jcoa x1mpyi22 xxymvpz xlup9mm x1kky2od\"><img class=\"xz74otr x15mokao x1ga7v0g x16uus16 xbiv7yw\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/td3/2/16/1f518.png\" alt=\"🔘\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" /></span>「北台灣共榮經濟圈」產業發展關鍵對談</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">主持人｜</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">今周刊發行人 梁永煌</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">與談人｜</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">臺北市政府產業發展局 陳俊安 局長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">新北市政府經濟發展局 盛筱蓉 局長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">桃園市政府經濟發展局 張誠 局長</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7029\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/522981679_733293726012799_2325828991172137767_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7030\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/520052968_733294592679379_866815285008851441_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '【 2025 全球台商經濟論壇】', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '7028-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:47:42', '2025-07-31 07:47:42', '', 7028, 'https://astcc.asia/7028-revision-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(7032, 10, '2025-07-31 15:48:46', '2025-07-31 07:48:46', '<div class=\"xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總32-3【台北市歡迎晚宴】</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!--more-->\r\n<div class=\"x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\">亞總於7月16日舉辦【台北市歡迎晚宴】，由台北市政府副秘書長俞振華代表市府出席，熱情接待來自亞洲各國的台商代表，促進彼此間的互動與合作，及深化經貿聯繫與城市交流，場面熱絡、氣氛融洽。</div>\r\n<div dir=\"auto\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-7033\" src=\"https://astcc.asia/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/522212214_733969185945253_1569249323808110019_n-250x167.jpg\" alt=\"\" /></div>\r\n</div>', '亞總32-3【台北市歡迎晚宴】', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e4%ba%9e%e7%b8%bd32-3%e3%80%90%e5%8f%b0%e5%8c%97%e5%b8%82%e6%ad%a1%e8%bf%8e%e6%99%9a%e5%ae%b4%e3%80%91', '', '', '2025-07-31 15:48:46', '2025-07-31 07:48:46', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=7032', 0, 'post', '', 0),
