(7328, 10, '2026-04-08 11:34:42', '2026-04-08 03:34:42', '<p data-start=\"37\" data-end=\"197\">第33屆亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會回國訪問團，由<span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">陳舒琴</span></span>總會長率團拜會<span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">江啟程</span></span>副院長接見，並與<span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">立法院</span></span>代表進行交流。江副院長於致詞時表示，此行猶如海外臺商「回娘家」，展現對臺灣深厚的情感連結與支持。</p>\r\n活動連結照片如下：\r\n<a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11XYEWWBrQFF_IWrKRzpHw_vymFYHy1lT?usp=drive_link\">https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11XYEWWBrQFF_IWrKRzpHw_vymFYHy1lT?usp=drive_link</a>', '第33屆亞洲臺灣商會聯合總會回國訪問團-立法院-2026年3月30日', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', '%e7%ac%ac33%e5%b1%86%e4%ba%9e%e6%b4%b2%e8%87%ba%e7%81%a3%e5%95%86%e6%9c%83%e8%81%af%e5%90%88%e7%b8%bd%e6%9c%83%e5%9b%9e%e5%9c%8b%e8%a8%aa%e5%95%8f%e5%9c%98-%e7%ab%8b%e6%b3%95%e9%99%a2-2026%e5%b9%b43', '', '', '2026-04-08 11:34:52', '2026-04-08 03:34:52', '', 0, 'https://astcc.asia/?p=7328', 0, 'post', '', 0),
